      "label": "Enslaved people as inherently suited only for manual labor",
      "description": "This stereotype reduces the humanity of Black people to their labor capacity, implying they are biologically or inherently suited only for physical work, which is a racist trope used to justify racial hierarchies and dehumanization. This is implicitly referenced in the meme's text and visual portrayal of enslaved people being forced to farm.",
