      "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype_2",
      "label": "Historical trauma of slavery as a justification for present-day racial hierarchies",
      "description": "The meme implicitly uses the historical trauma of slavery to reinforce present-day racist beliefs by suggesting that the historical oppression of Black people is a permanent or inherent condition, thereby legitimizing racial stereotypes and hierarchies. This requires external knowledge of how historical racism is weaponized in contemporary discourse.",
